{'symbol': 'AFL', 'date': '2021-11-17 06:30:00', 'title': 'AFLAC INCORPORATED BECOMES SIGNATORY TO PRINCIPLES FOR RESPONSIBLE INVESTMENT', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, GA., NOV. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AFLAC INCORPORATED (NYSE: AFL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BECOME A SIGNATORY OF PRINCIPLES FOR RESPONSIBLE INVESTMENT (PRI), THE LEADING GLOBAL NETWORK OF ASSET OWNERS, ASSET MANAGERS AND SERVICE PROVIDERS COMMITTED TO INCORPORATING ITS SIX PRINCIPLES, WHICH OFFER A BLUEPRINT OF POSSIBLE ACTIONS FOR INCORPORATING ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) ISSUES INTO ITS INVESTMENT AND OWNERSHIP DECISIONS.'}